OL,3,GNEWSAScottish crime writer Peter May
OL,4,Adies aged 74
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter May, one of Scotland's most
OL,7,Fprolific television writers and crime
OL,8,Fauthors, has died at the age of 74.
OL,10,FThe news of his death was announced by
OL,11,Fhis wife and fellow author Janice
OL,12,FHally, who said she had "no words" to
OL,13,Fexpress the loss.
OL,15,FMay died on Friday at his home in the
OL,16,Fsouth of France where he had lived for
OL,17,Fmany years and had been nominated for
OL,18,Fseveral awards.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
