OL,3,GNEWSAScottish crime writer Peter May
OL,4,Adies aged 74
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe sold about 15 million copies of his
OL,7,Fbooks around the world, and the novel
OL,8,Fhe said would be his last - Island of
OL,9,Fthe Dead - is to be published in
OL,10,FJanuary 2027.
